# Signalith's offline root keys, one base64 Ed25519 public key per line;
# # starts a comment. A root key's private half is kept offline by the
# maintainer, never in a workflow. It is trusted to sign agent manifests
# and content bundles as well as the online keys are, and it alone may
# sign a revocation list (docs/key-management.md). No revocation list can
# revoke a root key: replacing one needs a new release.
